  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Every braggart approaches their over-the-top fighting in a different way. They choose one combat sphere as their approach sphere, and gain it or a talent from it as a bonus talent. When they hit with an attack action using a sphere ability or combat talent from their approach sphere, they treat their attack roll as higher for the purposes of succeeding with flair. At 1st level, they treat applicable attack rolls as 1 higher, and treat them as 1 additional point higher at 5th level and every 5 levels thereafter, to a maximum of 5 points higher at 20th level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/braggart#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
